---
// Author bio block shown on the homepage and at the end of every article.
---

<section class="author-bio">
  <div class="bio-avatar" aria-hidden="true">C</div>
  <div class="bio-body">
    <h3 class="bio-title">About Clara</h3>
    <p class="bio-text">
      I'm Clara, and yes, I'm the one stuck with a single 24-inch wide bathroom
      vanity in my rented Chicago apartment. I started this blog because I got
      tired of buying "viral" organization bins that turned out to be two inches
      too wide for standard shelves. Everything you see here is bought with my
      own money, measured with my trusty tape measure, and tested in my actual
      messy life.
    </p>
    <p class="bio-contact">
      Drop me a line at <a href="mailto:hello@organizingsmall.com">hello@organizingsmall.com</a>
      if you're trying to fit a round peg in a square room.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .author-bio {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
    background: var(--color-bg-light, #f9fafb);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 0.75rem);
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .bio-avatar {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 3.25rem;
    height: 3.25rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-primary, #3b82f6);
    color: white;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .bio-body {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .bio-title {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-text, #1f2937);
  }

  .bio-text {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-light, #6b7280);
  }

  .bio-contact {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-light, #6b7280);
  }

  .bio-contact a {
    color: var(--color-primary, #3b82f6);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .author-bio {
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
